.DS_Store

# The runtime is copied in by `make runtime` from the one source of it in the world (the
# keel-runtime repository) and is never committed here -- invariant D2, keel-cloud
# `canon/designs/keel-skill-design.md` §3.1. `RUNTIME_VERSION`, which records *which* runtime this
# skill carries, is committed; the package it names is not. Rooted, so the fake runtime fixtures
# under tests/ are untouched.
/keel_runtime/

# The four packaging trees and the marketplace, built by `make dist` from the one source in
# this repository (design §8.1). Never committed: a copy a build step makes and a test compares.
/dist/
